Gekma"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb08e876-28c6-4a08-9bd1-84a9599a5011","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"`:mes` に限らず、一般的に ehcospace に表示されるメッセージの色情報って取れないですよね・・\nなので Vim 側で `:redir #\u0026gt; {buffer}` みたいのを用意してもらって、このリダイレクト中は任意のコマンドの出力が色付きで `{buffer}` に表示される、みたいにするしかなさそう… 色付けは syntax かテキストプロパティでやるとして","ts":"1616744848.166200","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1616744889.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J0p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4f146eb-b87c-4b0c-b3de-620d4e1a28dd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`:mes` の中身を色情報付きで取るまともな方法なさそう…","ts":"1616742721.163600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y3i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c05629a-cb88-40ae-8efb-a770a338eeae","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"Ex コマンドの出力も色付きでバッファに表示したいけど、まあできたら嬉しいというくらいで、別になくても困らないな・・","ts":"1616741653.163100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cp=pj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"329d98d5-7b45-4844-884a-f103534876bc","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"たしかに、シェルコマンドなら `:terminal` でいいですねぇ","ts":"1616741573.161700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uZEPc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"356b4297-18f5-466a-a7dd-ad9cf326cc23","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、いまならw","ts":"1616740426.161500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HHeNy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33D49373-E2FA-4FB7-8243-AEBD7EBD8F00","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":":terminal でやればいいでしょっていうひといそう","ts":"1616740217.160600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cA09"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0df30f43-6bec-4ad5-835e-eaa4578c5999","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","t